[solution]
# The PASS lines let each ritual resolve before the next is cast (the strict replay drifts without them; the relaxed
# minimality replay solved with three of them removed); the untap lines keep both Swamps (the Jackal's {B}{B}) and
# two Mountains (Temur Battle Rage) for combat.
cast Rite of Flame
untap: Mountain; Mountain; Mountain; Swamp; Swamp
cast Rite of Flame
PASS
cast Desperate Ritual
PASS
cast Pyretic Ritual
PASS
cast Seething Song
PASS
cast Hill Giant
cast Fervor
cast Brute Force
Hill Giant
cast Brute Force
Hill Giant
untap: Mountain; Mountain; Swamp; Swamp
at COMBAT_BEGIN: cast Temur Battle Rage
Hill Giant
untap: Swamp; Swamp
Hill Giant; Dauthi Jackal
activate Dauthi Jackal
